  "description": "Our entry-level fat bike from our Greek series with a high-end hydroformed frame, 1×9 gearing and durable components to take your freedom to the next level.\nThe Hercules fat bike can be ridden at 15 psi or lower. With Fat 4-inch tyres and a lower psi, you will find yourself floating through sand, snow, mud and other variable terrain, offering an off-road riding experience like no other. This fat bicycle is prepared for epic cruises along the beach, power slides on snow and solid adventure anywhere you take it. The 6061 hydroformed alloy frame has been built to handle like a dune buggy. The Hercules fat bike is strong, stable on rough terrain and will take you on paths deemed previously unrideable.",
